      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَفَاكُهٌ</span></b>  signifies The <i>jesting,</i> or <i>joking,</i> [or
<i>indulging in pleasantry,</i> (see 3,) of a number of
persons,] <i>one with another,</i> (K.) [You say,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تفاكهوا</span> <i>They jested,</i> &amp;c., <i>one with another.</i>]

